{
 "encounter_id": "00693",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Iyer. Terrible rain today. Did you manage to park? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. Yes, thank you, third floor of the car park, very inconvenient, but I managed. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Always the third floor. So, the knee. Tell me from the beginning. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Certainly. My right knee locks, sometimes it gets stuck and I cannot straighten it. This has been going on for two months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Locks how, stuck bent?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, bent, about thirty degrees I think. Then I wiggle it and it clicks free."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Interesting. And does it also let you down?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, giving way. On the stairs mostly, going down. Last week I nearly fell at the office."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "After badminton on Sundays, it swells up like a small football."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And pain on the stairs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pain, yes, on the inside of the knee when I climb the stairs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you fall or twist it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fall, no twisting that I recall."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any redness or heat over the knee?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No redness, no heat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through your tablets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day, every day, I take it regularly. Well, mostly. I sometimes miss the evening one if I come home late."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And diclofenac, maybe 50 mg? When the knee is bad. I will check the packet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies, none that I know of."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your other health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, and some osteoarthritis in the other knee."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any previous operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My appendix as a teenager, and a hernia repair in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Diabetes in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I am a bank manager, so much sitting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't drink any alcohol."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And badminton, how often?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Every Sunday morning with my son. I would hate to give it up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let me see the knee. Pulse 78, blood pressure 130 over 82, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, and weight 80 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little high, the pressure? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A touch, nothing alarming. Lie back, please. I'm going to bend the knee.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah, that is the sore spot. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness along the inner joint line, and I can feel a click when I bend and rotate it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that the lock? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly. Any trouble with your breathing, chest, anything like that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "My impression is a torn meniscus, the cartilage in the knee, but the scan will tell."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will I need surgery? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Maybe not. I'd like to arrange an MRI of the knee, and an X-ray of the knee as well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And how soon? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The MRI is a few weeks. I'd also like to do a blood test for your HbA1c, since the sugar affects healing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And is badminton allowed? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd rest it until the scan. Also, let's get a physiotherapist to see you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very well. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it locks again before the scan, come back sooner and we'll see you urgently."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, understood, thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
